cal work.","Recent years: works from 2024–2026 have had less than three years to be cited, so their values will rise.","Small base: the values for 2009–2015 and 2017–2026 are based on only 10–29 works (lighter box or hollow point), so read them with care.","Few works: 2016 has fewer than 10 works (2016: 7), too few for a band. Each of those works is drawn as a dot."]}}}